Falsifies `system_tests::user::unmap_tests::unmap_takes_one_page_and_the_frame_capability_survives_it`.

The defect: `AddressSpace::UNMAP` forgets the page-table half. It still finds the page (it asks
the tables rather than changing them) and still tombstones the record, so it answers `Ok(0)` and
`LIST` agrees with it, while the page stays mapped.

Expected to fail: the assertion that the page is gone from the tables after `UNMAP` returned 0.

diff --git a/kernel/src/syscall.rs b/kernel/src/syscall.rs
index f4089be81..96266e1b6 100644
